      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{68a9064d9b8a25d17e458d5b|full_name} Hi, there are multiple issues with this topic.\n\n1. You're requesting to change existing functionality; that would be a feature request, not a bug report. You've submitted this to the bug reports category.\n\n2. VRChat is unlikely to whitelist any virtual machines for security measures. Running VRChat in a virtual machine is documented, but not supported, and it may break at any moment. The request to allow virtual machines should be between ShadowPC and Epic Games, so this request may be misdirected at VRChat on this Canny.\n\n3. This topic is a duplicate of the following feature requests, and can be merged with those:\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/whitelist-shadow-pc-please\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/allow-shadowpc-players-to-play-vrchat",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
